@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
hide circle
hide empty members
title examples/：重複的盒子 → Object 盒 → Box<T>

package "① 重複的寫法（只投影）" #F7F1F1 {
  class StringBox {
    - value : String
    + get() : String
  }
  class IntegerBox {
    - value : Integer
    + get() : Integer
  }
}
package "② Object 盒（ObjectBox）" #FFF4E6 {
  class ObjectBox #FFE8D6 {
    - value : <b>Object</b>
    + get() : <b>Object</b>
  }
}
package "③ 泛型盒（Box、TypedBoxDemo）" #EAF6EC {
  class "Box<T>" as Box #DFF3E3 {
    - value : <b>T</b>
    + get() : <b>T</b>
  }
}
StringBox --> ObjectBox : 只寫一次，\n型態改成 Object
IntegerBox --> ObjectBox
ObjectBox --> Box : 只寫一次，\n型態留成空位 T
note bottom of ObjectBox
  什麼都放得進去，但取出要<b>自己轉型</b>：
  (String) message.get()
  轉錯型態 → <color:#C0392B><b>執行時</b>才 ClassCastException</color>
end note
note bottom of Box
  Box<String>、Box<Integer>：編譯器記得型態，
  取出<b>不必轉型</b>
  型態不符 → <color:#2E7D32><b>編譯時</b>就被拒絕</color>
end note
@enduml
